  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CHINOR - Research cooperation with China</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The research program CHINOR builds research and innovation partnerships between Chinese and Norwegian research groups, innovators and organisations, to support economic development and social welfare in China, and to develop the Chinese research and innovation capacity for long-term sustainable and equitable growth. We aim through world-class collaborations to address critical development challenges, including environment, climate, energy, food safety, food security and governance.</narrative>
  </description>
